{"availability":"available","full":"SoCloseSociety/neowatch","name":"neowatch","description":"📺 Self-hostable worldwide free live-TV, radio & public-domain-film aggregator — React PWA + Node. HLS player, multi-screen, EPG, TV/D-pad UX. Aggregates public streams (iptv-org / radio-browser / Internet Archive); hosts no content.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":5,"forks":1,"created":"2026-06-22T16:34:57Z","updated":"2026-10-06T11:32:40Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://neowatch.soclose.co","topics":["express","hls","hls-player","iptv","iptv-org","live-tv","pwa","radio","react","self-hosted","streaming","typescript","vite","zustand"],"demo":"https://neowatch.soclose.co/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T13:58:56.613Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T13:58:56.613Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T13:58:56.613Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T13:58:56.613Z","stars":5,"forks":1}],"technologies":["React","Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The self-hostable, worldwide free live-TV, radio & public-domain-film aggregator.","Thousands of the world's freely-available live channels, internet radio and public-domain movies — in one fast, installable app with an HLS player, a multi-screen mosaic, a TV guide, and a full SaaS layer. Every channel is free.","NEOWATCH is an aggregator and player for publicly-available media. It hosts no content: it indexes and plays streams that broadcasters already publish openly — live TV from the iptv-org directory, internet radio from radio-browser, and public-domain films from the Internet Archive. It ships as a fast React PWA backed by a thin Node/Express API, deployable as a single process on a small VPS."],"features":["🌍 12,000 live channels worldwide (every iptv-org category), normalized with logos, country, language, quality — all free to watch.","📻 Internet radio — 800+ stations from the radio-browser directory, with a sticky audio player.","🎬 Public-domain films — a browsable VOD catalog from the Internet Archive (classics, cult, documentaries), played natively.","📅 TV guide (EPG) — import an XMLTV source for now/next per channel + \"search by programme\".","⚡ Tuned hls.js — fast start, adaptive bitrate, low latency; YouTube embed support."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SoCloseSociety/neowatch/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f998f474b991e17b0e277f4a522b74941f9f58947629ea2f5f5b6f8a2c3c1405","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T13:58:56.743Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T13:58:56.743Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"The self-hostable, worldwide free live-TV, radio & public-domain-film aggregator.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SoCloseSociety/neowatch/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"📲 QR sign-in — scan a code on the TV to log in from your phone (no remote typing).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SoCloseSociety/neowatch/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"On first boot the server caches the iptv-org catalog (a few seconds) and creates an admin account — the email and a random password are printed once in the logs (pin them via .env).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SoCloseSociety/neowatch/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"f998f474b991e17b0e277f4a522b74941f9f58947629ea2f5f5b6f8a2c3c1405","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SoCloseSociety/neowatch/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T13:58:56.744Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-06T11:32:40Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SoCloseSociety/neowatch/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T13:58:56.744Z","hash":"f998f474b991e17b0e277f4a522b74941f9f58947629ea2f5f5b6f8a2c3c1405","originalBytes":9818,"storedBytes":9818,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["api","live","catalog","npm","features","web","internet","run","admin","build","channel","channels","epg","every","free","neowatch","radio","app